// Afterglow · Sub · answering rhythm · 174 BPM · A minor
// Second-drop bass answers the kick with a different rhythm.
// One cycle = one 4/4 bar. Sample slots are installed with this session.
setCpm(174 / 4)

$: note("<a1 a1 f1 f1 c2 c2 g1 g1>").struct("1 0 1 0 0 1 0 1").s("sine").attack(.008).release(.09).gain(0.344).lpf(150)
